      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ROBERT LOWRY PROPERTIES presents this LARGE, BRIGHT 2 BED, 2 BATH 1ST FLOOR APARTMENT (72 Sq. Metres) with ENSUITE BATHROOM, OPTION TO CONVERT ATTIC, SECURE GATED COMMUNAL PARKING FOR 2 CARS & LARGE KITCHEN/LIVING/DINING ROOM opening out to SOUTH FACING BALCONY. Manor Court is conveniently located in Clonsilla within walking distance of Blanchardstown SC, Blanchardstown Village, Coolmine Train Station, 37/39 Bus Services, Shops, Schools & Parks and close to Ballycoolin/Damastown, M50 & M3/N3. Accommodation consists of Entrance Hallway, Large Kitchen/Living/Dining Room with Patio Doors opening out to South Facing Balcony, 2 Double Bedrooms with Master Bedroom Ensuite & Built in Wardrobes and Main Bathroom with Bath & Shower. 4 Manor Court is also vacant and ready to sell with no onward chain. Please Contact Robert Lowry by email or phone @ 086-0236685.\n\nNote: Management Fees are 2,485 for 2026-2027.\nNote: Property is Rent Capped and was rented at 1750 per month (last reviewed in March 2026).\n\nACCOMMODATION:\nL Shaped Hallway: 4.5m x 1.3m (Approx)\nWith Laminate Wooden Flooring.\n\nLiving Area: 4.7m x 4.6m (Approx)\nWith Laminate Wooden Flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area: 5.3m x 2.3m\nWith Tiled Flooring, Fully Fitted Kitchen & Patio Doors to South Facing Balcony.\n\nBedroom 1: 3.7m x 3.6m\nWith Laminate Wooden Flooring & Built in Wardrobes and....\nEnsuite Bathroom:\nTiled Flooring & partly wall Tiled, Wc, Whb & Shower.\n\nBedroom 2: 3.8m x 3.2m\nWith Laminate Wooden Flooring & Built in Wardrobes.\n\nBathroom: 2.3m x 2m\nWith Tiled Flooring and partly wall tiled, Wc, Whb, Bath & Electric Shower.\n\nHighlights\nLarge, Bright, 2 Bed, 2 Bath 1st Floor Apartment measuring 72 Sq Metres.\nOption to convert Attic into another Room.\nSecure Gated Communal Parking For 2 Cars.\nMain Bathroom and Ensuite Bathroom.\nLarge Kitchen/Living/Dining Room opening out to South facing Balcony.\n2 Double Bedrooms with Built in Wardrobes.\nWithin walking distance to Blanchardstown SC, Blanchardstown Village, Coolmine Train Station, 37/39 Bus Services, Shops, Schools & Parks.\nClose to Ballycoolin/Damastown Business Parks, M50 & M3/N3.\nProperty is Vacant with No Chain and ready to Sell.\nBER Rating: C.\n\n"
